### Disposable HTTPS/GreenMail fixture only. See README.acceptance.md.
### No real Gmail account or existing database; do not persist credential/response history.
### {{fixtureGmailId}} must belong to {{fixtureUserToken}}. Select UID and UIDVALIDITY
### from current fixture list, never guess them. Only delete explicitly synthetic test mail.

### Owner list — 200 metadata only
GET {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/gmail-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Link App Password CREATE — 201 new / 409 GMAIL_DUPLICATE
POST {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/gmail-accounts/app-password
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{fixtureMailboxEmail}}",
  "appPassword": "{{fixtureAppPassword}}",
  "displayName": "Disposable mailbox",
  "intent": "CREATE"
}

### Explicit update/add method — 200 METHOD_UPDATED/METHOD_ADDED (same mailbox)
POST {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/gmail-accounts/app-password
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{fixtureMailboxEmail}}",
  "appPassword": "{{fixtureAppPassword}}",
  "intent": "UPSERT"
}

### Disabled App Password link: set ALLOW_APP_PASSWORD_LINK=false while OAuth stays true,
### confirm public config and use the valid POST above (not GET list); expect 403.
### Restore original settings immediately after the probe.

### Rename fixture mailbox
PATCH {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/gmail-accounts/{{fixtureGmailId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Disposable mailbox renamed"
}

### Preferred method, only if already linked
PUT {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/gmail-accounts/{{fixtureGmailId}}/preferred-method
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preferredMethod": "APP_PASSWORD"
}

### Folders
GET {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/mails/folders?gmailId={{fixtureGmailId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List/search
GET {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/mails?gmailId={{fixtureGmailId}}&folder=INBOX&page=0&size=10&q=manual-fixture
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Preview without marking Seen — attachment sizeAccuracy may be ESTIMATED/UNKNOWN
GET {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/mails/{{fixtureGmailId}}/INBOX/{{fixtureUid}}?uidValidity={{fixtureUidValidity}}&loadRemote=false&markSeen=false
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Open, marks Seen
GET {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/mails/{{fixtureGmailId}}/INBOX/{{fixtureUid}}?uidValidity={{fixtureUidValidity}}
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Binary download index 0: actual Content-Length may differ from estimate
GET {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/mails/{{fixtureGmailId}}/INBOX/{{fixtureUid}}/attachments/0/download?uidValidity={{fixtureUidValidity}}
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Accept: */*

### Flags: star + mark unread
PUT {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/mails/{{fixtureGmailId}}/INBOX/{{fixtureUid}}/flags?uidValidity={{fixtureUidValidity}}
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seen": false,
  "starred": true
}

### Restore flags if required
PUT {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/mails/{{fixtureGmailId}}/INBOX/{{fixtureUid}}/flags?uidValidity={{fixtureUidValidity}}
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seen": true,
  "flagged": false
}

### Send only to the synthetic loopback mailbox; multipart modern shape.
### For byte-accurate generated attachment tests use manual-http.cjs multipart.
POST {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/mails/send
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=fixture-example

--fixture-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="payload"
Content-Type: application/json

{"gmailId":{{fixtureGmailId}},"to":["{{fixtureMailboxEmail}}"],"cc":[],"bcc":[],"subject":"disposable example","textBody":"Synthetic content"}
--fixture-example--

### Move exact synthetic message to Trash — 204, no body.
### After move, refresh source and Trash; do not reuse INBOX UID for Trash.
DELETE {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/mails/{{fixtureGmailId}}/INBOX/{{fixtureSyntheticUid}}?uidValidity={{fixtureUidValidity}}&permanent=false
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}

### Trash without explicit confirmation — 400 PERMANENT_DELETE_REQUIRED_IN_TRASH
DELETE {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/mails/{{fixtureGmailId}}/TRASH/{{fixtureTrashUid}}?uidValidity={{fixtureTrashUidValidity}}
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}

### Explicit permanent delete of verified synthetic message only — 204.
### Confirm correct marker, Trash UID and UIDVALIDITY first; never bulk delete.
DELETE {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/mails/{{fixtureGmailId}}/TRASH/{{fixtureTrashUid}}?uidValidity={{fixtureTrashUidValidity}}&permanent=true
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}

### Unlink only a disposable mailbox — 204; does not delete remote messages.
DELETE {{fixtureBaseUrl}}/api/gmail-accounts/{{fixtureGmailId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{fixtureUserToken}}
